## Secret Inventory & Scope

| Secret Name | Scope | Stored In | Purpose |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `MASTER_KEY` | Backend API | Cloudflare Secrets / `.env` | Administrative route authorization |
| `TURSO_AUTH_TOKEN` | Backend & Scraper | Cloudflare Secrets / `.env` | Turso LibSQL database queries |
| `R2_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY` | Backend & Scraper | Cloudflare Secrets / `.env` | Cloudflare R2 object storage access |
| `LAMENT_API_KEY` | Web Proxy | SvelteKit `.env` | Client authorization injected server-side |

---

## Secret Storage Best Practices

- **Never Commit Secrets**: All `.env` files are specified in `.gitignore`.
- **Server-Side Injection**: SvelteKit server routes inject `LAMENT_API_KEY` server-side, preventing API credentials from leaking to browser JavaScript bundles.
- **Cloudflare Worker Secrets**: Deploy production backend secrets using `wrangler secret put <SECRET_NAME>`.
